data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":77,"item_id":"rs_08e6e0849afe74ee016aca2f2b210c819588f44ba293ed473c","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Testing port availability**\n\nI'm considering how to test port availability, specifically using a dynamic port through a child port. It seems I can't know which free net port to use since there's no logging. It might be simpler to assign a test port, like 18991, which I could use as an ephemeral port for the server test. This will help ensure I can get a free port effectively."}

